"settings.server_switching.how_it_works.privacy.title" = "Your privacy";
"settings.server_switching.how_it_works.switching.body" = "When you open the app at another server's home, on its Wi-Fi network or inside its Home zone, that server is opened automatically. The server you are viewing always wins when homes overlap. If you switch manually, your choice is respected until you leave or stop using the app for a while.";
